Ask user house price.
Ask user deposit.
Ask user interest rate for year in percent.
Ask user number of year.
Loan is price minus deposit.
Monthly rate is interest rate divide 100 divide 12.
Number of month is years multiply 12.
Payment is loan multiply monthly rate divide (1 minus (1 plus monthly rate) power minus number of month).
Round payment to 2 decimal.
Show loan.
Show payment for month.
Total is payment multiply number of month.
Show total.
